{"item_uid": "指考97-physics-008", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 8, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "如圖 4 所示，一瓷碗之碗口直徑為 12 公分，中央深度為 8.0 公分。在此碗注滿水後，\n於其中央放置一顆小豆子，眼睛在距離水面 18 公分的水平面之 1、2、3、4 和 5 位\n置，注視碗中的小豆子。1 號位置是在碗中央的正上方，而相鄰位置各相隔 6 公分。\n有哪些位置可以看見碗中的小豆子？（假設水的折射率為 4/3）", "options": {"A": "僅有 1", "B": "僅有 1 和 2", "C": "僅有 2 和 3", "D": "僅有 1、2、3 和 4", "E": "5 個位置都可以看到\n1 2 3 4 5\n眼睛\n18公分\n12公分\n8公分\n豆子\n(示意圖，未按比例繪製)\n圖 4\n-2-\n第 3 頁 97年指考\n共 7 頁 物理考科"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 2.0, "B": 24.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 29.0, "E": 31.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 19.0, "E": 58.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 2.0, "B": 35.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 35.0, "E": 11.0}, "omit_rate": 10.0, "p_value": 31.0, "p_high": 58.0, "p_low": 10.0, "discrimination": 48.0, "p_quintiles": [68.0, 40.0, 24.0, 14.0, 8.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考97-physics-009", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 9, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "如圖 5 所示，一直角三角形線圈兩邊長分別為 a及 l、電阻為 R，以等速度 v 通過一\n範圍為 d（d>a）強度為 B 的均勻磁場，磁場的方向為垂直射入紙面，在時間 t=0 時，\n線圈的前緣恰接觸磁場的邊緣。則線圈上的感應電流 i 與時間 t 的關係圖是下列何\n者？(設電流逆時針方向為正)\nB\na\nv\nl\nd\n圖 5", "options": {"A": "", "B": "i i\nt\n0 a/v d/v (a+d)/v\nBlv/R\nt\n-Blv/R\n0 a/v d/v (a+d)/v", "C": "", "D": "i\ni Blv/R\nt\nBlv/R d/v (a+d)/v\n0 a/v\nt\na/v d/v (a+d)/v -Blv/R\n0", "E": "i\nBlv/R\nt\nd/v (a+d)/v\n0 a/v\n-Blv/R\n-3-\n97年指考 第 4 頁\n物理考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 10.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 10.0, "D": 19.0, "E": 35.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 4.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 18.0, "E": 65.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 14.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 17.0, "E": 10.0}, "omit_rate": 19.0, "p_value": 35.0, "p_high": 65.0, "p_low": 10.0, "discrimination": 55.0, "p_quintiles": [74.0, 49.0, 29.0, 16.0, 8.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考97-physics-010", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 97, "year_ce": 2008, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 10, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔80分)", "stem": "某生利用二極體做整流實驗，他想測試整流電路中的二極體和負載電阻 R 是否均能\n正常工作，於是將二極體與電阻兩元件的組合(如圖 6)取下後，以設在歐姆檔位的三\n用電表做測量。如下列所示，甲〜戊為三用電表「＋」、「－」接頭與元件的各種可\n能接法：\n甲：+接 U， −接 W 乙：+接 W， −接 U U V\n丙：+接 U， −接 V 丁：+接 V， −接 U\n戊：+接 V， −接 W R\n下列測試過程的選項中，何者可以用最少的步驟，完整且正確地判\n斷各元件是否均能正常工作？\nW", "options": {"A": "甲", "B": "乙、然後丙", "C": "丙、然後戊\n圖 6", "D": "丙、丁、然後戊", "E": "乙、丙、丁、然後戊"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 12.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 34.0, "D": 16.0, "E": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 13.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 37.0, "D": 25.0, "E": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 11.0, "B": 14.0, "C": 31.0, "D": 10.0, "E": 3.0}, "omit_rate": 27.0, "p_value": 16.0, "p_high": 25.0, "p_low": 10.0, "discrimination": 15.0, "p_quintiles": [30.0, 16.0, 13.0, 11.0, 9.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
